{
  "id": 8833356955847,
  "title": "Custom Tree of Life Quilt Set Celtic Yggdrasil Bedding",
  "handle": "custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-bedding-97b4844050-97b4844050",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty of the Tree of Life with this custom quilt set by Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this versatile farmhouse-style quilt offers lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy comfort during winter, making it an ideal choice for year-round indoor or outdoor use.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize every aspect of this quilt, including the background, framing color, and text saying squares to feature your own words or names.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Comfort:</strong> Made from 100% soft polyester with high-quality silk floss filling, providing a breathable and durable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multi-functional design works perfectly as a bed quilt, picnic mat, throw blanket, or cozy wrap for camping and backyard lounging.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent present for men, women, moms, dads, or special occasions like Christmas, Valentine's, Mother's, and Father's Day.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from various sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and quickly dries, designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling for low-maintenance care.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree of Life-ds10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of life, flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
